   "line": [
    "Bd7"
   ],
   "spoken": "By the book we develop the bishop — not Bf5, which allows Nxf5, but Bd7. Not every piece needs an active job; some just connect the rooks and sit quietly, and that's fine.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A modestly-placed developing move that connects the rooks beats a flashy square that hangs."
