    "Nxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now the metal detector goes off: Nxd4. The knight is defended by the queen, but taking drags the queen onto d4 — a square x-rayed by our bishop on g7. That x-ray is the seed of a discovered attack.",
   "kind": "main",
